%22description%22%3A%22Platform-prefixed%20port%20call%20identifier%22%2C%22example%22%3A8390561783%7D%2C%22installation%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Installation%20\(terminal%2Frefinery\)%20name%20of%20the%20port%20call%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Rotterdam%22%7D%2C%22zone%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Zone%20name%20where%20the%20port%20call%20took%20place%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Rotterdam%22%7D%2C%22country%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Country%20of%20the%20port%20call%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Netherlands%22%7D%2C%22startAt%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Port%20call%20start%20\(ISO%208601%2C%20UTC\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-05-01T01%3A38%3A23Z%22%7D%2C%22endAt%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Port%20call%20end%20\(ISO%208601%2C%20UTC\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-05-02T01%3A38%3A23Z%22%7D%2C%22eta%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Port%20call%20estimated%20time%20of%20arrival%20\(ISO%208601%2C%20UTC\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-06-15T08%3A00%3A00Z%22%7D%2C%22sourceEta%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Source%20of%20the%20port%20call%20ETA%20\(e.g.%20AIS%2C%20Market\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22AIS%22%7D%2C%22isShipToShip%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22boolean%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Whether%20the%20port%20call%20is%20a%20ship-to-ship%20operation%22%2C%22example%22%3Afalse%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Port%20call%20linked%20to%20a%20leg%20event.%20Included%20when%20expand%20contains%20port_calls.%22%2C%22required%22%3A%5B%22id%22%5D%7D%2C%22LegDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22imo%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Unique%20International%20Maritime%20Organization%20\(IMO\)%20number%20assigned%20to%20the%20vessel%22%2C%22example%22%3A1044522%7D%2C%22vesselName%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22The%20vessel's%20current%20registered%20name%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22Front%20Altair%22%7D%2C%22vesselId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Unique%20ID%20assigned%20to%20vessels%20visible%20on%20the%20Kpler%20Terminal%22%2C%22example%22%3A121205%7D%2C%22chronologyId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Unique%20identifier%20for%20the%20chronology.%20Mutable%20when%20chronologies%20are%20recomputed.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222c46aa3c-7eba-48f2-856f-fe986fa16cc3%22%7D%2C%22legId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Stable%20identifier%20derived%20from%20the%20vessel%20id%20and%20the%20leg's%20anchor%22%2C%22example%22%3A%2249806cd3-4541-3c19-a668-acd5a5c1dfe7%22%7D%2C%22fromVesselEventId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Id%20of%20the%20event%20that%20opens%20the%20leg%2C%20if%20any%22%2C%22example%22%3A%228389779811%22%7D%2C%22toVesselEventId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Id%20of%20the%20event%20that%20closes%20the%20leg%2C%20if%20any%22%2C%22example%22%3A%228390561783%22%7D%2C%22fromVesselEventCategory%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Category%20of%20the%20event%20that%20opens%20the%20leg%2C%20if%20any%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22PortCall%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FVesselEventCategory%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22toVesselEventCategory%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Category%20of%20the%20event%20that%20closes%20the%20leg%2C%20if%20any%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22PortCall%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FVesselEventCategory%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22startAt%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22When%20the%20leg%20started%2C%20as%20an%20ISO%208601%20UTC%20instant.%20Null%20value%20means%20the%20leg%20is%20the%20first%20ever%20leg%20of%20the%20vessel.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-05-03T12%3A58%3A00.000Z%22%2C%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22endAt%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22When%20the%20leg%20ended%2C%20as%20an%20ISO%208601%20UTC%20instant.%20Null%20value%20means%20the%20leg%20is%20the%20last%20open%20leg%20of%20the%20vessel.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-06-01T17%3A36%3A21.000Z%22%2C%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22cargoOnBoard%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Cargo%20on%20board%20when%20the%20leg%20opens%2C%20taken%20from%20the%20from-event%20when%20it%20is%20a%20port%20call%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FVesselCargoDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22fromZoneId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Zone%20of%20the%20port%20call%20that%20opens%20the%20leg%3B%20absent%20when%20no%20such%20port%20call%22%2C%22example%22%3A1001%7D%2C%22fromParentZoneIds%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Parent%20zones%20of%20the%20port%20call%20that%20opens%20the%20leg%2C%20the%20zone%20itself%20first%3B%20absent%20when%20no%20such%20port%20call%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B1001%2C10%2C1%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%7D%2C%22toZoneId%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Zone%20of%20the%20port%20call%20that%20closes%20the%20leg%3B%20absent%20when%20no%20such%20port%20call%22%2C%22example%22%3A3003%7D%2C%22toParentZoneIds%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Parent%20zones%20of%20the%20port%20call%20that%20closes%20the%20leg%2C%20the%20zone%20itself%20first%3B%20absent%20when%20no%20such%20port%20call%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B3003%2C30%2C3%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%7D%2C%22fromPortCall%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Port%20call%20that%20opens%20the%20leg.%20Present%20only%20when%20expand%20includes%20port_calls%20and%20fromVesselEventCategory%20is%20PortCall.%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FPortCallDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22toPortCall%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Port%20call%20that%20closes%20the%20leg.%20Present%20only%20when%20expand%20includes%20port_calls%20and%20toVesselEventCategory%20is%20PortCall.%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FPortCallDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22tonMiles%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Ton-miles%20for%20the%20leg%2C%20in%20ktm%20\(kilo%20ton-miles\).%20Present%20when%20%60expand%60%20includes%20%60tonnage_metrics%60.%20Null%20when%20no%20tonnage%20data%20exists%20for%20this%20leg.%22%2C%22example%22%3A71.68%2C%22anyOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22tonDays%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Ton-days%20for%20the%20leg%2C%20in%20ktd%20\(kilo%20ton-days\).%20Present%20when%20%60expand%60%20includes%20%60tonnage_metrics%60.%20Null%20when%20no%20tonnage%20data%20exists%20for%20this%20leg.%22%2C%22example%22%3A71.68%2C%22anyOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22distance%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Distance%20travelled%20on%20the%20leg%2C%20in%20nautical%20miles.%20Present%20when%20%60expand%60%20includes%20%60tonnage_metrics%60.%20Null%20when%20no%20tonnage%20data%20exists%20for%20this%20leg.%22%2C%22example%22%3A10.129%2C%22anyOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22duration%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Duration%20of%20the%20leg%2C%20in%20days.%20Present%20when%20%60expand%60%20includes%20%60tonnage_metrics%60.%20Null%20when%20no%20tonnage%20data%20exists%20for%20this%20leg.%22%2C%22example%22%3A0.041%2C%22anyOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22speed%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Median%20speed%20in%20knots.%20Present%20when%20%60expand%60%20includes%20%60tonnage_metrics%60.%20Null%20when%20no%20tonnage%20data%20exists%20for%20this%20leg%20or%20no%20speed%20values.%22%2C%22example%22%3A9.129%2C%22anyOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22oneOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22type%22%3A%22null%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%2C%22required%22%3A%5B%22vesselId%22%2C%22chronologyId%22%2C%22legId%22%5D%7D%2C%22LegsResponseDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22legs%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Legs%20matching%20the%20request%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegDto%22%7D%7D%7D%2C%22required%22%3A%5B%22legs%22%5D%7D%2C%22RangeFilterDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22gte%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22minimum%22%3A0%2C%22description%22%3A%22Minimum%20value%20\(greater%20than%20or%20equal\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A50000%7D%2C%22lte%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22minimum%22%3A0%2C%22description%22%3A%22Maximum%20value%20\(less%20than%20or%20equal\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A300000%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Inclusive%20numeric%20range%20filter%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%2C%20and%20gte%20must%20be%20less%20than%20or%20equal%20to%20lte%20when%20both%20are%20set%22%7D%2C%22DateRangeFilterDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22gte%22%3A%7B%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Minimum%20value%20\(greater%20than%20or%20equal\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-05-03T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%7D%2C%22lte%22%3A%7B%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Maximum%20value%20\(less%20than%20or%20equal\)%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-06-01T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Inclusive%20date-time%20range%20filter%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%2C%20and%20gte%20must%20be%20less%20than%20or%20equal%20to%20lte%20when%20both%20are%20set%22%7D%2C%22EndAtRangeFilterDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22gte%22%3A%7B%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Minimum%20value%20\(greater%20than%20or%20equal\)%3B%20must%20be%20on%20or%20after%202017-01-01%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-05-03T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%7D%2C%22lte%22%3A%7B%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Maximum%20value%20\(less%20than%20or%20equal\)%3B%20must%20be%20on%20or%20after%202017-01-01%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-06-01T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Inclusive%20date-time%20range%20filter%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%2C%20and%20gte%20must%20be%20less%20than%20or%20equal%20to%20lte%20when%20both%20are%20set%22%7D%2C%22LegsMatchersDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22imos%22%3A%7B%22minItems%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20unique%20International%20Maritime%20Organization%20\(IMO\)%20numbers%20assigned%20to%20vessels%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B9123456%2C9345678%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22minimum%22%3A1%7D%7D%2C%22vesselIds%22%3A%7B%22minItems%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20unique%20IDs%20assigned%20to%20vessels%20visible%20on%20the%20Kpler%20Terminal%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B12345%2C67890%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22minimum%22%3A1%7D%7D%2C%22vesselClassifications%22%3A%7B%22minItems%22%3A1%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FVesselClassification%22%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22The%20commercial%20grouping%20of%20ships%2C%20used%20to%20distinguish%20vessel%20sizes%20within%20a%20market%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B%22VLCC%22%2C%22Suezmax%2FLR3%22%5D%7D%2C%22deadweight%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20deadweight%20tonnage%20range%20in%20tonnes%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FRangeFilterDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22startAt%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20leg%20start%20instant%20\(ISO%208601%20UTC%20date%20or%20date-time\)%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FDateRangeFilterDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22endAt%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20leg%20end%20instant%20\(ISO%208601%20UTC%20date%20or%20date-time\)%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FEndAtRangeFilterDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22cargoOnBoard%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20cargo%20on%20board%3B%20at%20least%20one%20of%20gte%20or%20lte%20must%20be%20set%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FRangeFilterDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22fromZoneIds%22%3A%7B%22minItems%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20zone%20and%20parent%20zones%20of%20the%20port%20call%20that%20open%20the%20leg%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B1001%2C2002%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22minimum%22%3A1%7D%7D%2C%22toZoneIds%22%3A%7B%22minItems%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Filter%20by%20zone%20and%20parent%20zones%20of%20the%20port%20call%20that%20close%20the%20leg%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B3003%2C4004%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22minimum%22%3A1%7D%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Filters%20applied%20to%20leg%20queries%22%7D%2C%22LegsPaginationDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22limit%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22maximum%22%3A10000%2C%22minimum%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Maximum%20number%20of%20legs%20to%20return%20per%20request%22%2C%22default%22%3A100%2C%22example%22%3A100%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Pagination%20options%20for%20leg%20queries%22%7D%2C%22LegSortField%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22startAt%22%2C%22endAt%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Leg%20field%20to%20sort%20by%22%7D%2C%22LegSortOrder%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22asc%22%2C%22desc%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Sort%20order%22%7D%2C%22LegsSortDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22field%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Leg%20field%20to%20sort%20by%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22endAt%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSortField%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22order%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Sort%20order%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22desc%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSortOrder%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Sort%20rule%20for%20leg%20queries%22%2C%22required%22%3A%5B%22field%22%2C%22order%22%5D%7D%2C%22ExpandTarget%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22port_calls%22%2C%22tonnage_metrics%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Related%20resources%20to%20embed%20in%20each%20leg.%20Enrichment%20is%20opt-in%20and%20off%20by%20default.%22%7D%2C%22LegsRequestDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22matchers%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Filters%20to%20narrow%20the%20leg%20results%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegsMatchersDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22pagination%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Pagination%20options%22%2C%22default%22%3A%7B%22limit%22%3A100%7D%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegsPaginationDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22sort%22%3A%7B%22minItems%22%3A1%2C%22maxItems%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Sort%20rules%22%2C%22default%22%3A%5B%7B%22field%22%3A%22endAt%22%2C%22order%22%3A%22desc%22%7D%5D%2C%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegsSortDto%22%7D%7D%2C%22expand%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FExpandTarget%22%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Related%20resources%20to%20embed%20in%20each%20leg.%20Enrichment%20is%20opt-in%20and%20off%20by%20default.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%5B%22port_calls%22%5D%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Request%20body%20for%20listing%20voyage%20legs%22%7D%2C%22LegSeriesPeriodDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%7B%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Start%20of%20the%20chart%2C%20inclusive%20\(ISO%208601%20UTC%20date%20or%20date-time\).%20Defaults%20to%202017-01-01.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222017-01-01T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%7D%2C%22to%22%3A%7B%22format%22%3A%22date-time%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22End%20of%20the%20chart%2C%20inclusive%20\(ISO%208601%20UTC%20date%20or%20date-time\).%20Defaults%20to%20now%20\(UTC\).%20Must%20be%20on%20or%20after%20from%20and%20not%20after%20the%20end%20of%20the%20current%20UTC%20day.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%222026-06-01T00%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Chart%20time%20range%20for%20the%20series%22%7D%2C%22LegSeriesAggField%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22endAt%22%2C%22startAt%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Leg%20timestamp%20used%20as%20the%20histogram%20bucket%20key%3A%5Cn%20%20%20-%20endAt%3A%20bucket%20by%20leg%20end%20\(default\)%5Cn%20%20%20-%20startAt%3A%20bucket%20by%20leg%20start%5Cn%20%20%20Required%20as%20startAt%20when%20completionState%20is%20set%20\(open%20legs%20have%20no%20leg%20end%20timestamp\).%22%7D%2C%22LegSeriesGranularity%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22daily%22%2C%22weekly%22%2C%22monthly%22%2C%22quarterly%22%2C%22yearly%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Time%20granularity%20for%20the%20series%20buckets%22%7D%2C%22LegSeriesAggMetric%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22legs%22%2C%22voyages%22%2C%22vessels%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Aggregation%20metric%3A%5Cn%20%20%20-%20legs%3A%20number%20of%20legs%20in%20each%20period%5Cn%20%20%20-%20voyages%3A%20number%20of%20distinct%20voyages%20with%20at%20least%20one%20leg%20in%20the%20period%5Cn%20%20%20-%20vessels%3A%20number%20of%20distinct%20vessels%20with%20at%20least%20one%20leg%20in%20the%20period%5Cn%20%20%20When%20matchers.cargoOnBoard%20restricts%20legs%20to%20laden%20or%20ballast%2C%20voyages%20counts%20distinct%20voyages%20among%20matching%20legs%20only.%5Cn%20%20%20Not%20supported%20with%20loadingState%20split%3A%20voyages%20\(one%20voyage%20can%20include%20both%20ballast%20and%20laden%20legs\).%20Not%20supported%20with%20completionState%20split%3A%20voyages%20\(one%20voyage%20can%20include%20both%20open%20and%20closed%20legs\).%22%7D%2C%22LegSeriesSplitBy%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22vesselClassification%22%2C%22loadingState%22%2C%22completionState%22%2C%22fromZone%22%2C%22toZone%22%5D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Dimension%20to%20split%20series%20data%20by%3A%5Cn%20%20%20-%20vesselClassification%3A%20commercial%20vessel%20size%20groupings%5Cn%20%20%20-%20loadingState%3A%20ballast%20\(cargo%20on%20board%20is%20zero\)%2C%20loaded%20\(cargo%20on%20board%20%3E%200\)%2C%20or%20unknown%20\(cargo%20on%20board%20is%20missing\).%20Use%20legs%20or%20vessels%2C%20not%20voyages.%5Cn%20%20%20-%20completionState%3A%20open%20\(no%20leg%20end%20timestamp\)%20vs%20closed.%20Requires%20startAt%20as%20the%20bucket%20key%20\(open%20legs%20have%20no%20leg%20end%20timestamp\).%20Use%20legs%20or%20vessels%2C%20not%20voyages.%5Cn%20%20%20-%20fromZone%3A%20top%20N%20opening%20port%20zones%20\(leg.fromZoneId\)%20plus%20Others.%5Cn%20%20%20-%20toZone%3A%20top%20N%20closing%20port%20zones%20\(leg.toZoneId\)%20plus%20Others.%22%7D%2C%22LegsSeriesRequestDto%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22object%22%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%22matchers%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Filters%20to%20narrow%20the%20leg%20results.%20The%20series%20accepts%20the%20same%20filters%20as%20POST%20%2Flegs.%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegsMatchersDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22period%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Chart%20time%20range%20for%20the%20series.%20When%20you%20omit%20from%2C%20it%20defaults%20to%202017-01-01.%20When%20you%20omit%20to%2C%20it%20defaults%20to%20now%20\(UTC\).%20Neither%20bound%20may%20be%20after%20the%20end%20of%20the%20current%20UTC%20day.%20When%20from%20is%20after%20to%2C%20the%20API%20rejects%20the%20request.%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSeriesPeriodDto%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22aggField%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Leg%20timestamp%20used%20as%20the%20histogram%20bucket%20key%3A%5Cn%20%20%20-%20endAt%3A%20bucket%20by%20leg%20end%20\(default\)%5Cn%20%20%20-%20startAt%3A%20bucket%20by%20leg%20start%5Cn%20%20%20Required%20as%20startAt%20when%20completionState%20is%20set%20\(open%20legs%20have%20no%20leg%20end%20timestamp\).%22%2C%22default%22%3A%22endAt%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22endAt%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSeriesAggField%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22granularity%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Time%20granularity%20for%20the%20series%20buckets%22%2C%22default%22%3A%22monthly%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22monthly%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSeriesGranularity%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22aggMetric%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Aggregation%20metric%3A%5Cn%20%20%20-%20legs%3A%20number%20of%20legs%20in%20each%20period%5Cn%20%20%20-%20voyages%3A%20number%20of%20distinct%20voyages%20with%20at%20least%20one%20leg%20in%20the%20period%5Cn%20%20%20-%20vessels%3A%20number%20of%20distinct%20vessels%20with%20at%20least%20one%20leg%20in%20the%20period%5Cn%20%20%20When%20matchers.cargoOnBoard%20restricts%20legs%20to%20laden%20or%20ballast%2C%20voyages%20counts%20distinct%20voyages%20among%20matching%20legs%20only.%5Cn%20%20%20Not%20supported%20with%20loadingState%20split%3A%20voyages%20\(one%20voyage%20can%20include%20both%20ballast%20and%20laden%20legs\).%20Not%20supported%20with%20completionState%20split%3A%20voyages%20\(one%20voyage%20can%20include%20both%20open%20and%20closed%20legs\).%22%2C%22default%22%3A%22legs%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22legs%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSeriesAggMetric%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22splitBy%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Dimension%20to%20split%20series%20data%20by%3A%5Cn%20%20%20-%20vesselClassification%3A%20commercial%20vessel%20size%20groupings%5Cn%20%20%20-%20loadingState%3A%20ballast%20\(cargo%20on%20board%20is%20zero\)%2C%20loaded%20\(cargo%20on%20board%20%3E%200\)%2C%20or%20unknown%20\(cargo%20on%20board%20is%20missing\).%20Use%20legs%20or%20vessels%2C%20not%20voyages.%5Cn%20%20%20-%20completionState%3A%20open%20\(no%20leg%20end%20timestamp\)%20vs%20closed.%20Requires%20startAt%20as%20the%20bucket%20key%20\(open%20legs%20have%20no%20leg%20end%20timestamp\).%20Use%20legs%20or%20vessels%2C%20not%20voyages.%5Cn%20%20%20-%20fromZone%3A%20top%20N%20opening%20port%20zones%20\(leg.fromZoneId\)%20plus%20Others.%5Cn%20%20%20-%20toZone%3A%20top%20N%20closing%20port%20zones%20\(leg.toZoneId\)%20plus%20Others.%22%2C%22example%22%3A%22vesselClassification%22%2C%22allOf%22%3A%5B%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FLegSeriesSplitBy%22%7D%5D%7D%2C%22numberOfSplits%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22number%22%2C%22maximum%22%3A65536%2C%22minimum%22%3A1%2C%22description%22%3A%22Desired%20number%20of%20split%20values%20to%20return%20when%20vesselClassification%2C%20fromZone%2C%20or%20toZone%20is%20set.%20Defaults%20to%2010.%20Returns%20top%20N%20splits%20plus%20an%20Others%20bucket%20for%20the%20remainder%20when%20more%20values%20exist.%20Ignored%20when%20loadingState%20or%20completionState%20is%20set.%22%2C%22default%22%3A10%2C%22example%22%3A10%7D%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%22Request%20body%20for%20leg%20series%20aggregation%22%7D%2C%22LegSeriesDatasetValues%22%3A%7B%22type%22%